20261111T205622Z-final-ac-x3-luna,final-sevra-nodebb-plugin-blog-comments-revert-review-bias,exp-blocking-only-v1,openai/gpt-6-luna@latest,2,CWE-352: undoes the fix for GHSA-43m5-c88r-cjvv (XSS due to lack of CSRF validation for replying/publishing),"The change removes CSRF middleware from both state-changing POST routes. The reply handler creates a comment, and the publish handler creates a topic; neither handler enforces a CSRF token, so the existing router middleware was an active protection rather than redundant wiring.",Removing `middleware.applyCSRF` from `/comments/reply` and `/comments/publish` weakens CSRF protection and permits cross-site requests to trigger comment replies or article publication using a victim's authenticated session.,y,Claude suggestion: names removed CSRF protection on POST routes
