20261111T205622Z-final-ac-x3-luna,final-sevra-phpfastcache-revert,security-sensitive-review-v2,openai/gpt-6-luna@latest,1,CWE-94: undoes the fix for GHSA-484f-743f-6jx2 (Object injection in cookie driver in phpfastcache),"The change passes the entire JSON-decoded cookie structure to `decode()`, while the existing expiration-date path passes `decode()` the scalar `t` field. This is inconsistent with decoding the wrapped cookie data and risks warnings, invalid results, or failed cache reads for valid entries.","Decode the appropriate encoded field(s), not the whole JSON-decoded wrapper; as written, valid cookie entries may no longer be readable.",n,Claude suggestion: only decode/format mismatch or broken reads; deserialization not named
